// Title: trace normalization renames each map key's `#<digits>` alone, so
// distinct keys collide and the map loses entries before comparison.
// Command: graphix-fuzz run fuzz-main-aux-fresh-cells-map-collapse.gx
// Expected: every mode Trace([0:{"#1" => 10, "#2" => 20}]).
// Observed: every mode Trace([0:{"#0" => 10}]): both keys became "#0" and the
//   entry holding 20 is gone, so a run producing {"#1" => 10, "#2" => 99}
//   compares equal to this one.
{"#1" => i64:10, "#2" => i64:20}
